8.
Functions of National Accreditation Board.
- The functions of the National Accreditation Board shall be as follows, namely :-
(a)
to lay down rules of transaction of business for Zonal Accreditation Boards and the National Accreditation Board;
(b)
to sanction the manning levels and the number of the Secretariat staff at the National Accreditation Board and Zonal
